# SLAAPS output wiring on the Pixhawk 6X (2026-11-23): canards on MAIN1-4 (PX4IO, 333 Hz), EDF on AUX1 (pwm_out, PWM 400 Hz).
# Load AFTER slaaps_vehicle.params and slaaps_canard_trims.params, then reboot. See docs/SLAAPS_6X_FLASH_AND_BOOT.md.
# MAIN MIN/CENT/MAX are the trim-corrected canard pulses: SLA_Cn_PWM_NEG/CTR/POS shifted by SLA_Cn_ZERO (3.5/-10/-4.5/2 deg,
# about 11.1 us/deg). Routing requires an exact match: after any SLA_Cn_ZERO change `slaaps status` reports routing_fault=8 on
# that MAIN channel and these values must follow. Canards revoke to no pulse (DIS/FAIL 0).
# QGC's parameter editor limits PX4IO disarmed/failsafe to 800-2200. If QGC does not load PWM_MAIN_DIS/FAIL 0 from this
# file, enter them in Analyze Tools > MAVLink Console (param set PWM_MAIN_DIS1 0, ...) and check with param show.
# EDF: Lucid ESC calibrated 1000-2000 us; off = minimum = failsafe = 1000 us (the stop pulse it arms on while disarmed);
# zero throttle in armed Manual is the same stop pulse (lead, 2026-11-22). AUX2-9 unused (TIM1-3 0, no DShot).
# Vehicle-Id	Component-Id	Name	Value	Type
1	1	PWM_MAIN_FUNC1	10100	6
1	1	PWM_MAIN_FUNC2	10101	6
